@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5080

### Process health (does not check database readiness)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Search one city (requires configured SQL database; may fetch the live source)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"location":"Leeds"}

### Invalid city input: validation response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"location":""}

### Supported locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/locations

### Unsupported location (400; no database or scraper access)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"location":"Banana"}
